{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29038","headline":"题勤尊师历阳山居 · 许浑","name":"题勤尊师历阳山居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二十知兵在羽林，中年潜识子房心。\n苍鹰出塞胡尘灭，白鹤还乡楚水深。\n春坼酒瓶浮药气，晚携棊局带松阴。\n鸡笼山上云多处，自斸黄精不可寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29038.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29038","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}